# Overlay run set for the overlay-contended page.
# Format: col row fgHex rank text. text runs to end of line.
# rank is the stacking rank, 0 being front-most.
# Foreground is chosen per run to contrast with its local background.
14 12 FFFFFF 1 BEHIND RUN
22 12 000000 0 FRONT RUN
4 20 FFFFFF 2 UNCONTESTED LINE
